multi:
type: txt
priority: 400
help: Domain Name Server (DNS) domain completion order
syntax:expression: exec "${vyos_libexec_dir}/validate-value  --exec \"${vyos_validators_dir}/fqdn \"  --value \'$VAR(@)\'"; "Invalid domain name (RFC 1123 section 2).\nMay only contain letters, numbers and period."
end: sudo sh -c "${vyshim} ${vyos_conf_scripts_dir}/system_host-name.py"
